{% extends '@CitadelAureum/core/docs/layout.html.twig' %}

{% block article %}
    <p>
        Packages logs deliveries that arrive for guests, so nothing sits
        unclaimed in the back office and any team member can answer "has my
        parcel arrived?" with certainty.
    </p>

    <h2>Common tasks</h2>
    <ol class="au-docs-steps">
        <li>When a delivery arrives, open <strong>General → Packages</strong> and log it as <strong>received</strong> with the guest's details.</li>
        <li>When the guest collects it, mark it <strong>picked up</strong>. The change is recorded in the package's log.</li>
    </ol>

    <div class="au-docs-note">
        <i class="ph ph-info"></i>
        <p>
            Packages still marked received appear in the dashboard's attention
            list, so chase them before checkout day.
        </p>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
